***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** Docker Compose environment selection
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** Local dev (default):
COMPOSE_FILE=compose.yml:compose.dev.yml
COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME=dev
***REMOVED*** VPS production (set on VPS):
***REMOVED*** COMPOSE_FILE=compose.yml:compose.vps.yml
***REMOVED*** COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME=vps

***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** REQUIRED FOR BOT PROFILE (make docker-bot-up)
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=

***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** LOCAL EMBEDDINGS (BGE-M3, default for dev and VPS)
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
BGE_M3_TIMEOUT=120
COLBERT_TIMEOUT=120
RERANK_CANDIDATES_MAX=10
***REMOVED*** Skip reranking when RRF fusion score >= threshold
***REMOVED*** Must be > 1/61 (≈0.01639, single-query top-1 RRF) to avoid always skipping
SKIP_RERANK_THRESHOLD=0.018
OMP_NUM_THREADS=4
MKL_NUM_THREADS=4

***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** DATABASE CREDENTIALS (compose services)
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=postgres  ***REMOVED*** Change in production!
REDIS_PASSWORD=dev_redis_pass  ***REMOVED*** Change in production!
***REMOVED*** Optional native-run override. When unset, the bot derives:
***REMOVED*** REDIS_URL=redis://:${REDIS_PASSWORD}@localhost:6379
REDIS_MAXMEMORY=512mb  ***REMOVED*** dev: 512mb, VPS: 256mb (default in compose.yml)

***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** REQUIRED FOR ML PROFILE (make docker-ml-up, langfuse)
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=   ***REMOVED*** generate: openssl rand -base64 32
SALT=              ***REMOVED*** generate: openssl rand -base64 32
ENCRYPTION_KEY=    ***REMOVED*** generate: openssl rand -hex 32

***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** DEV INFRASTRUCTURE (optional overrides, defaults work out of the box)
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD=clickhouse
***REMOVED*** MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=miniosecret
***REMOVED*** LANGFUSE_REDIS_PASSWORD=langfuseredis

***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** LLM PROVIDERS (at least one required for bot profile)
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=

***REMOVED*** Anthropic Claude API (optional)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=[REDACTED-ANTHROPIC-KEY]

***REMOVED*** Qdrant Vector Database
***REMOVED*** Local development (Docker internal):
QDRANT_URL=http://localhost:6333
QDRANT_API_KEY=your-qdrant-api-key-here
QDRANT_COLLECTION=gdrive_documents_bge
QDRANT_HISTORY_COLLECTION=conversation_history
***REMOVED*** HISTORY_RELEVANCE_THRESHOLD=0.7  ***REMOVED*** Min similarity score for history results (0.0-1.0, default 0.7; ***REMOVED***433)

***REMOVED*** BGE-M3 Embedding API (Docker internal, used by bot automatically)
***REMOVED*** BGE_M3_URL=http://localhost:8000

***REMOVED*** Docling API (optional)
DOCLING_URL=http://localhost:5001

***REMOVED*** Unified Google Drive ingestion (required for ingestion service / VPS deploys)
GDRIVE_SYNC_DIR=/absolute/path/to/drive-sync
GDRIVE_COLLECTION_NAME=gdrive_documents_bge
INGESTION_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@postgres:5432/cocoindex

***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** DEV STACK CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================

***REMOVED*** Telegram Bot (TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN defined above in required section)
BOT_USERNAME=
LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
CLIENT_DIRECT_PIPELINE_ENABLED=true
SUPERVISOR_MAX_TOKENS=1024
***REMOVED*** TTFT drift warning threshold (ms). Raise for reasoning models behind proxy (***REMOVED***675)
TTFT_DRIFT_WARN_MS=500
***REMOVED*** Runtime reasoning request params forwarded by the graph/generation path.
***REMOVED*** LiteLLM keeps provider configs static; these envs tune per-request kwargs instead.
***REMOVED*** REASONING_EFFORT=low         ***REMOVED*** gpt-oss-120b: low/medium(default)/high
***REMOVED*** REASONING_FORMAT=hidden      ***REMOVED*** gpt-oss-120b: hidden/parsed/raw/none
***REMOVED*** DISABLE_REASONING=true       ***REMOVED*** zai-glm-4.7: true/false

***REMOVED*** Qdrant Quantization (bot)
QDRANT_QUANTIZATION_MODE=off
QDRANT_USE_QUANTIZATION=true
QDRANT_QUANTIZATION_RESCORE=true
QDRANT_QUANTIZATION_OVERSAMPLING=2.0

***REMOVED*** Small-to-big context expansion (bot)
SMALL_TO_BIG_MODE=off
SMALL_TO_BIG_WINDOW_BEFORE=1
SMALL_TO_BIG_WINDOW_AFTER=1
MAX_EXPANDED_CHUNKS=10
MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS=8000

***REMOVED*** LightRAG (uses OpenAI for LLM and embeddings)
***REMOVED*** OPENAI_API_KEY is already defined above

***REMOVED*** Langfuse (optional - for LLM tracing)
***REMOVED*** LANGFUSE_HOST is for host-side tools and browser-accessible local dev.
***REMOVED*** Containerized services use LANGFUSE_DOCKER_HOST and default to the Docker network alias.
***REMOVED*** On VPS without local Langfuse, set both LANGFUSE_HOST and LANGFUSE_DOCKER_HOST
***REMOVED*** to the same reachable value (for example https://cloud.langfuse.com).
LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=[REDACTED-LANGFUSE-KEY]
LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=[REDACTED-LANGFUSE-KEY]
LANGFUSE_HOST=http://localhost:3001
LANGFUSE_DOCKER_HOST=http://langfuse:3000
***REMOVED*** Isolate traces by environment in Langfuse UI (prod/staging/dev). Optional.
***REMOVED*** LANGFUSE_TRACING_ENVIRONMENT=staging
***REMOVED*** Flush config (defaults match Langfuse SDK: flush_at=512, flush_interval=5.0s). Optional.
***REMOVED*** LANGFUSE_FLUSH_AT=512
***REMOVED*** LANGFUSE_FLUSH_INTERVAL=5.0
***REMOVED*** Prompt label to fetch from Langfuse (default: production). Optional.
***REMOVED*** LANGFUSE_PROMPT_LABEL=production

***REMOVED*** Search & retrieval tuning
***REMOVED*** SEARCH_TOP_K=20                    ***REMOVED*** Qdrant hybrid search top-k (default 20)
***REMOVED*** RELEVANCE_THRESHOLD_RRF=0.005      ***REMOVED*** Min RRF score to keep a document (default 0.005)

***REMOVED*** Content filter / guard
***REMOVED*** GUARD_MODE=hard                    ***REMOVED*** hard (block) | soft (flag+continue) | log (log only)

***REMOVED*** MLflow (optional - for experiment tracking)
MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI=http://localhost:5000

***REMOVED*** Voyage AI (OPTIONAL — legacy, not used in default dev/VPS config)
***REMOVED*** VOYAGE_API_KEY=
VOYAGE_EMBED_MODEL=voyage-3-large
VOYAGE_CACHE_MODEL=voyage-3-lite
VOYAGE_RERANK_MODEL=rerank-2

